{"cu/w": {"key": "cu/w", "head": "ξύω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξύω (ἀπο-) To remove irregularities from the surface of, scrape smooth : λίστροισιν δάπεδον ξῦον <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"456\">Od. 22.456</a>. To treat so as to produce a smooth surface upon : ἑανόν, ὅν οἱ Ἀθήνη ἔξυσʼ ἀσκησασα <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"179\">Il. 14.179</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ceinodo/kos": {"key": "ceinodo/kos", "head": "ξεινοδόκος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξεινοδόκος -ου, ὁ [ξεῖνος + δοκ-, δέχομαι.] A host, one&#x27;s host <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"354\">Il. 3.354</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"210\">Od. 8.210</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"543\">543</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"55\">Od. 15.55</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"70\">70</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"18\" data-line=\"64\">Od. 18.64</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "canqo/s": {"key": "canqo/s", "head": "ξανθός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξανθός -ή, -όν. Yellow. Of horses, bay or chestnut <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"407\">Il. 9.407</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"680\">Il. 11.680</a>. Of hair, yellow, fair <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"197\">Il. 1.197</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"141\">Il. 23.141</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"13\" data-line=\"399\">Od. 13.399</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"13\" data-line=\"431\">431</a>. As a personal epithet, of the fair hair, fair-haired. Of Meleager <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"2\" data-line=\"642\">Il. 2.642</a>. Of Menelaus <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"284\">Il. 3.284</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"434\">434</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"183\">Il. 4.183</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"210\">210, etc</a>. : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"285\">Od. 1.285</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"168\">Od. 3.168</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"257\">257</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"326\">326, etc</a>. So κάρη ξανθὸς Μενέλαος Od. 15.133. Of Demeter <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"500\">Il. 5.500</a>. Of Agamede <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"740\">Il. 11.740</a>. Of Rhadamanthus <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"564\">Od. 4.564</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"7\" data-line=\"323\">Od. 7.323</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ci/fos": {"key": "ci/fos", "head": "ξίφος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξίφος -εος, τό. Dat. pl. ξιφέεσσι <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"7\" data-line=\"273\">Il. 7.273</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"337\">Il. 16.337</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"530\">Il. 17.530</a>. ξίφεσι Il. 13.147, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"26\">Il. 14.26</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"712\">Il. 15.712</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"637\">Il. 16.637, etc</a>. : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"443\">Od. 22.443</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"527\">Od. 24.527</a>. A sword <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"194\">Il. 1.194</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"210\">210</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"220\">220</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"2\" data-line=\"45\">Il. 2.45</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"18\">Il. 3.18, etc</a>. : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"2\" data-line=\"3\">Od. 2.3</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"406\">Od. 8.406</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"531\">Od. 11.531</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"80\">Od. 16.80</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"326\">Od. 22.326, etc</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ce/nios": {"key": "ce/nios", "head": "ξένιος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξένιος -η, -ον [ = ξείνιος.] 1 That serves as a symbol of the obligations of a guest in reference to his host or of the claims of a stranger to protection : ἴστω ξενίη τράπεζα Od. 14.158= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"155\">Od. 17.155=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"20\" data-line=\"230\">Od. 20.230</a>. 2 = ξείνιος 1 <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"389\">Od. 14.389</a>. 3 Absol. in neut. pl. = ξείνοις3 <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"514\">Od. 15.514</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"546\">546</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cesto/s": {"key": "cesto/s", "head": "ξεστός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξεστός -ή, -όν [ξεσ-, ξέω.] Smoothed, smooth, wrought, polished : αἰθούσῃσιν (of wrought stone) Il. 6.243, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"20\" data-line=\"11\">Il. 20.11</a>, λίθοιο <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"6\" data-line=\"244\">Il. 6.244</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"6\" data-line=\"248\">248. Cf</a>. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"18\" data-line=\"504\">Il. 18.504</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"138\">Od. 1.138=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"54\">Od. 4.54=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"7\" data-line=\"174\">Od. 7.174=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"370\">Od. 10.370 =</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"137\">Od. 15.137=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"93\">Od. 17.93</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"406\">Od. 3.406</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"6\">Od. 8.6</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"211\">Od. 10.211 =</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"253\">253</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"172\">Od. 12.172</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"350\">Od. 14.350</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"408\">Od. 16.408</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"18\" data-line=\"33\">Od. 18.33</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"566\">Od. 19.566</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"72\">Od. 22.72</a>. Of the Trojan horse : ἵππῳ ἔνι ξεστῷ <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"272\">Od. 4.272</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ca/nqos": {"key": "ca/nqos", "head": "Ξάνθος-1.", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">Ξάνθος-1. The divine name of the river of the Trojan plain west of Troy called (<a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"20\" data-line=\"74\">Il. 20.74) by men</a> Σκάμανδρος. Zeus his father <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"434\">Il. 14.434</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"2\">Il. 21.2</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"693\">Il. 24.693</a>. Ξάνθος (βαθυδινήεις , βαθυδίνης, δινήεις , ἐϋρρεῖος) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"6\" data-line=\"4\">4</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"560\">Il. 8.560</a>; the ford <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"434\">Il. 14.434</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"2\">Il. 21.2</a> , <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"693\">Il. 24.693</a>; <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"40\">Od. 3.40</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"15\">Il. 21.15</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"146\">146</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"332\">332</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"337\">337</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"383\">383</a>. Σκάμανδρος (βαθυδινήεις, βαθυδίνης, δινήεις, δῖος, διοτρεφής, ἐΰρροος, ἠϊόεις) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"36\">Il. 5.36</a>; his priest <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"77\">Il. 5.77</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"774\">Il. 5.774</a> , <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"7\" data-line=\"329\">Il. 7.329</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"499\">Il. 11.499</a> , <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"21\">Il. 12.21</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"124\">Il. 21.124</a> , <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"223\">223</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"305\">305</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"603\">603</a>; his springs <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"148\">Il. 22.148</a>.</div><div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">Ξάνθος-2 (δινήεις, ῥέων). A river of Lycia <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"2\" data-line=\"877\">Il. 2.877</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"479\">Il. 5.479</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"6\" data-line=\"172\">Il. 6.172</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"313\">Il. 12.313</a>.</div><div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">Ξάνθος-3 Trojan. Son of Phaenops-1. With his brother Thoon-1 killed by Diomedes <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"152\">Il. 5.152</a>.</div><div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">Ξάνθος-4. One of Hector&#x27;s horses <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"185\">Il. 8.185</a>.</div><div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">Ξάνθος-5 (πόδας αἰόλος). One of the horses of Achilles by Zephyrus out of Podarge <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"149\">Il. 16.149</a> , <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"400\">Il. 19.400</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"405\">405</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"420\">420</a>.</div>", "src": "hompers"}, "ce/w": {"key": "ce/w", "head": "ξέω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξέω 3 sing. aor. ἔξεσε <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"81\">Il. 5.81</a>. ξέσσε Od. 5.245, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"341\">Od. 17.341</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"44\">Od. 21.44. (</a>ἀμφι-) 1 To remove roughness or irregularities from the surface of, smooth, work up <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"245\">Od. 5.245</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"341\">Od. 17.341 =</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"44\">Od. 21.44</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"199\">Od. 23.199</a>. 2 With ἀπό, to slice off : ἀπὸ δʼ ἔξεσε χεῖρα <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"81\">Il. 5.81</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "custo/n": {"key": "custo/n", "head": "ξυστόν", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξυστόν -οῦ, τό [neut. of ξυστός, vbl. adj. from ξύω. That which is worked smooth.] 1 A spear <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"469\">Il. 4.469=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"260\">Il. 11.260</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"565\">Il. 11.565</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"13\" data-line=\"497\">Il. 13.497</a>. 2 Some kind of long pole used in sea-fighting <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"388\">Il. 15.388</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"677\">677</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cunh/ios": {"key": "cunh/ios", "head": "ξυνήϊος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξυνήϊος [ξυνός.] In common : τεύχεʼ ἀμφότεροι ξυνήϊα ταῦτα φερέσθων <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"809\">Il. 23.809</a>. Absol. in neut. pl. ξυνήϊα, a common store : οὔ τί που ἴδμεν ξυνήϊα κείμενα πολλά (laid up in abundance) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"1\" data-line=\"124\">Il. 1.124</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cuno/s": {"key": "cuno/s", "head": "ξυνός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξυνός -ή, -όν. Common : γαῖʼ ἔτι ξυνή [ἐστιν] Il. 15.193. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"262\">Il. 16.262</a>. Impartial <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"18\" data-line=\"309\">Il. 18.309</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cu/lon": {"key": "cu/lon", "head": "ξύλον", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξύλον -ου, τό. 1 A piece of wood, a post <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"327\">Il. 23.327</a>. 2 In pl., wood for burning, firewood : ξύλα πολλὰ λέγεσθε Il. 8.507. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"547\">Il. 8.547</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"18\" data-line=\"347\">Il. 18.347</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"364\">Il. 21.364</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"778\">Il. 24.778</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"429\">Od. 3.429</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"436\">Od. 8.436</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"418\">Od. 14.418</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"322\">Od. 15.322, etc</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "curo/n": {"key": "curo/n", "head": "ξυρόν", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξυρόν -οῦ, τό. A razor. Fig. : ἐπὶ ξυροῦ ἵσταται ἀκμῆς ἢ . . . ἠὲ . . . <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"173\">Il. 10.173</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "chrai/nw": {"key": "chrai/nw", "head": "†ξηραίνω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">†ξηραίνω [ξηρός = ξερός.] 3 sing. aor. pass. ἐξηράνθη. (ἀγ-) To dry up <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"345\">Il. 21.345</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"348\">348</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cu/loxos": {"key": "cu/loxos", "head": "ξύλοχος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξύλοχος -ου, ἡ [ξύλον.] A wood, coppice, thicket <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"162\">Il. 5.162</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"415\">Il. 11.415</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"573\">Il. 21.573</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"335\">Od. 4.335=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"126\">Od. 17.126</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"445\">Od. 19.445</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cai/nw": {"key": "cai/nw", "head": "ξαίνω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξαίνω To comb or card (wool) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"423\">Od. 22.423</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "cero/s": {"key": "cero/s", "head": "ξερός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ξερός Dry. Absol. in neut., the dry land, the shore : ποτὶ ξερὸν ἠπείροιο <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"402\">Od. 5.402</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}}